| “the resources have been retrieved”                                                                                    | Goal     | This is a required state of affairs before delivery can begin.                                                                                                                      |
| “the delivery phase begins”                                                                                            | Task     | This identifies a specific phase/process in the mission execution.                                                                                                                  |
