| “take all the resources to the specified location”                                                                     | Goal     | This expresses the desired delivery state: all resources are at the specified location.                                                                                             |
| “battery of the assigned robot”                                                                                        | Resource | The battery is a physical resource whose availability/charge level affects mission execution.                                                                                       |
